Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: adwaita-icon-theme, fonts-dejavu-core, librsvg2-common
Description: Notepad++ source code editor - native GTK 3 port (preview)
 Unofficial native Linux build of the Notepad++ source tree using the GTK 3
 backend of Scintilla. This preview provides tabbed editing in two views,
 syntax highlighting for all Notepad++ languages via Lexilla, Notepad++
 colour themes, encoding detection, Boost-regex find/replace, sessions with
 snapshots of unsaved documents, recent files, detection of outside file
 changes, and a single-instance mode compatible with Notepad++ switches.
 .
 Plugins, docking panels, macros and the Preferences dialog are not yet ported.
